            "sid": "EZK 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eky'okubanza eky'okwezi okwa ikumi n'ebiri okw'omwaka ogwa ikumi n'ebiri, MUKAMA akangambira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe mwana w'omuntu; oterre Faraaho omukama wa Misiri empamo omugambire oti: “Nooyeteekereza nk'entale enyakuli omu mahanga, baitu noosisana nk'ekijoka ekinyakuli omu mayanja; obaliza omu bisaaru byawe, otabangura amaizi n'ebigere byawe, kandi osiisa ebisaaru eby'amayanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oku, nuho hali Asiriya n'ekitebe kye, ebituuro by'abantu baabo bagyehinguliriize, abo boona abaagwire omu bulemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaaziikirwe omu bicweka ebya hara muno eby'ekiina, abantu be beehinguliriize ekituuro kye; abo boona abaagwire omu bulemu, abaatanisaaga ab'omunsi ey'aboomeezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eramu nayo nuho oku, abantu baayo boona beehinguliriize ekituuro kyayo; abo boona abaagwire omu bulemu, abaasirimukire nyabuyonga batasazirwe, abaatiinisaaga ab'omunsi ey'aboomeezi, hati nibaswazibwa hamu n'abo abanyakusirimuka omukiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamwaliire ekitabu hagati y'abo abantu be boona, ebituuro byabo bimwehinguliriize, abo boona abatarasazirwe, abaagwire omu bulemu; habwokuba, baatinisaga ab'omunsi ey'aboomeezi hati nibaswazibwa hamu n'abo abanyakusirimuka omukiina; baheebwa ekiikaro hagati y'abo abaisirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meseki na Tubali, nazo nuho ziri, n'abantu baazo boona, ebituuro by'abantu baabo bibeehinguliriize, abo boona abatarasazirwe abaagwire omu bulemu; habwokuba, baatiinisaaga ab'omunsi ey'aboomeezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bataziikwe n'ekitiinisa nk'emanzi ezaira, abaasirimukire nyabuyonga bajwaire ebyokurwanisa, ebitara byabo babikiikire ha mabega, engabu zaabo baihagatiire. Abantu abo, ira bakaba bali b'amaani muno, nibatiinisa ab'omunsi ey'aboomeezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, olihendwahendwa, oikale hagati y'abatarasazirwe, abaagwire omu bulemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Edomu nayo eri oku, abakama n'abalemi baayo boona, noobwakubaire bakaba bali b'obusobozi obutagambwa, hati bali hamu n'abo abaagwire omu bulemu; bali hamu n'abatarasazirwe, hamu n'abo abanyakusirimuka omukiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abalemi aba ha bukiizi bw'emoso, nabo bali oku, abo boona, n'Abaasidoni, abaasirimukire baina ensoni, hamu n'abaisirwe, noobwakubaire baatiinisaaga muno abantu habw'obusobozi bwabo; baroho aho batasazirwe, hamu n'abo abaagwire omu bulemu, nibaswazibwa hamu n'abo abanyakusirimuka omukiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Okurora abantu abo boona baisirwe, kulihuumuza Faraaho n'ihe rye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Ogu, ira ayatiinisaaga ab'omunsi ey'aboomeezi yoona; hati nuwe ali n'abo abatarasazirwe abaagwire omu bulemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
